      "url": null,
      "image_sources": []
    },
    {
      "text": "Combine luncheon meat, eggs, Cheddar cheese, and onion in a bowl. Add mayonnaise, chili sauce, salt, and hot sauce. Mix well.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": []
    },
    {
      "text": "Spread meat mixture over hamburger bun halves. Place on a baking sheet.",
